<decision #track.parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds.wait-for-config-mechanism apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEC>
  压缩阈值参数化如何推进？
  </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEC>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKED>
    先建占位 track，到达即停在 human confirm，等用户提供通用配置机制方案。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKED>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEE>
    本 track 不预设实现；proposal.md 只记录已收集的隐式默认值位置/文件/传递逻辑；track.xml 唯一任务带 human confirm，mission 走到 G4 即停下。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEE>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEF>
    用户明确要求先用通用机制给本项目加配置项配置文件，再实施参数化；未确认前不预设实现。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEF>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEG>
    mission.track3-stop 决策；用户讨论；AiAgentExecutor.ts/ContextCompressor.ts 硬编码位置。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEG>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds.vfs-consumer-interface apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEH>
  cell 层 VFS 消费接口如何设计？
  </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEH>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEJ>
    ai-support 新增 RuntimeConfigVfsLoader。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEJ>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEK>
    在 ai-support 新增从 ResourceVFS 读取配置并解析 typed options 的 loader（RuntimeConfigVfsLoader）；与现有 LocalFileRuntimeConfigLoader 并存，新路径走 VFS，旧路径保留兼容。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEK>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEM>
    用户确认；cell 层从 VFS 读取（不碰文件系统），terminal 构造 VFS。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEM>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEN>
    用户决策；cell 包依赖关系；LocalFileRuntimeConfigLoader 现状。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEN>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds.default-json-location apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEP>
  bunfs 默认 json 放哪个 cell 包？
  </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEP>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEQ>
    ai-support。VFS 没有则取默认配置。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEQ>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKER>
    默认配置 json 内嵌在 ai-support；VFS 中无对应文件时，RuntimeConfigVfsLoader 用内嵌默认配置兜底。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKER>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKES>
    用户确认；ai-support 是 cell 层真正读配置文件的层，默认 json 就近消费。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKES>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKET>
    用户决策；ai-support 现有 ConfigLoader 位置。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKET>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds.vfs-scope apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEV>
  ResourceVFS 的 scope 是什么？
  </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEV>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEW>
    通用文件树（含 skill/agent/prompt 等），本期只做配置文件。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEW>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEX>
    symbiont 的 ResourceVFS 设计为通用文件树（对齐 sparrow 的 CONFIG_FILE_NAMES + RESOURCE_DIR_NAMES），但本 track 只实现配置文件路径（/.eidolon/*.json）。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEX>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEY>
    用户确认；symbiont 是可迁移通用能力，设计上支持完整文件树，本期收敛到配置。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEY>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEZ>
    用户决策；sparrow ResourceVFS 设计。
    </?01M05F1PPFDDM5AKFNV3H3GKEZ>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.parameterize-tool-result-compaction-thresholds.circular-dependency-backlog apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
